<Positioned left="40" top="8"><Text fontSize="30" color="#FFFFFFFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">从需求到可复现交付 · 依赖解释图</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="40" top="46"><Text fontSize="20" color="#94A3B8FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">行 = 拓扑层（上→下）；实线为有向先决依赖，虚线为反馈关系（不参与排序）</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1020" top="8" width="540"><Container alignment="CENTER_RIGHT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#5EEAD4FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">14 节点 · 16 条先决边 · 2 条反馈边</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1020" top="34" width="540"><Container alignment="CENTER_RIGHT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#FBBF24FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">先决边一律向下，无指向过去层的歧义</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1020" top="56" width="540"><Container alignment="CENTER_RIGHT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#94A3B8FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">交叉线无连接点即不构成新的依赖</Text></Container></Positioned>
